# Generated worlds and recordings.
#
# fixtures/ is not committed on purpose: it is ~4MB of binary protobuf that
# one command rebuilds, and the generator is seeded, so anyone who clones this
# reproduces the numbers in EVAL.md exactly:
#
#     python3 -m dispatch.cli fixtures
#     python3 -m dispatch.cli eval
#
fixtures/
recordings/

# Local state
*.db
dispatch.db

# Secrets. NVIDIA_API_KEY belongs in your shell, not in the repo.
#
# git history is permanent: committing a key and deleting it in a later commit
# does NOT remove it, and GitHub's secret scanners find public keys in minutes.
# If one ever lands here, revoke it at build.nvidia.com rather than trying to
# scrub the history.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*credentials*.json
secrets.*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
